1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,521
When they say that chongqing is a 5 d city this is what they mean.
人们说重庆是“5D城市”，说的就是这种情况。

2
00:00:03,521 --> 00:00:08,320
Right now I'm walking in a beautiful main square it's a historic place beautiful temples.
我现在走在一座美丽的主广场上，这里有历史古迹和漂亮的庙宇。

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:12,630
But you actually realize that you're on the 22 nd floor of a building.
但你会发现，自己其实站在一栋楼的二十二层。

4
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:17,201
The craziest thing is we were walking on ground level from my hotel the whole way to get here.
最不可思议的是，我们从酒店一路沿地面走到这里。

5
00:00:17,201 --> 00:00:21,111
And it just felt like everything was flat we didn't even realize that we were this high.
一路感觉都是平地，根本没意识到已经这么高。

6
00:00:21,121 --> 00:00:24,881
I've been to almost every big city in asia but I've never felt something like this.
我几乎去过亚洲每座大城市，但从没体验过这样的事。

7
00:00:24,881 --> 00:00:29,121
Where you're just standing in a main square and you realize that you're on the 22 nd floor of a building.
你就站在主广场上，然后意识到自己是在建筑的二十二层。

8
00:00:29,121 --> 00:00:34,320
It's totally mind blowing like I don't understand how the architects were able to build a city like this.
太震撼了，我都不明白建筑师是怎样建起这种城市的。

9
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:39,280
The only comparison would be hong kong which is kind of similar with the hills and stuff but nothing like chongqing you know.
唯一能比的大概是香港，那里也有山坡，但重庆还是很不同。

10
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:47,430
Traveling chongqing more than anywhere else on the asian continent really gives me some culture shock totally lost in translation.
在重庆旅行，比在亚洲其他地方更让我感到文化冲击；仿佛一切都隔着语言。

11
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:51,201
Not a single sign is translated in english it is all completely in chinese.
他当时感到，标牌没有英文翻译，看到的都是中文。

12
00:00:51,201 --> 00:00:57,761
The reason that all these people are gathering here on this sidewalk is because the metro comes straight out of the building.
这些人聚在这条人行道上，是因为地铁会直接从建筑里开出来。

13
00:00:57,761 --> 00:01:04,521
It's funny how there's like few touristy things to do in the city and wherever they are there's like mobs of people chinese tourists.
有趣的是，他觉得城里少数热门景点无论在哪里，都聚着大群中国游客。

14
00:01:04,721 --> 00:01:09,121
After watching the metro go through the side of this building I just have to ride it for myself.
看过轻轨穿楼后，我一定得亲自坐一趟。

15
00:01:09,121 --> 00:01:13,751
It goes without saying chongqing's metro is on a whole another level literally.
不用说，重庆的轨道交通真是在另一个层次，字面意义上也是。

16
00:01:13,761 --> 00:01:20,070
On the train we go going to bring in a shop on the train.
上车了；后面一小段车上话语自动识别不清，原词保留待核。

17
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:23,430
We're making a lot of friends here but they're quite shy where are you going right now.
我们在这里认识了不少朋友，不过他们挺害羞的。你们现在要去哪里？

18
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:27,591
Hot pot but it's too hot for hot pot you need a cold pot.
去吃火锅。不过这么热还吃火锅？你们需要一口“冷锅”吧。

19
00:01:27,601 --> 00:01:32,481
What do you like about chongqing it's really nice and the food is wonderful.
你喜欢重庆什么？这里很好，而且食物很棒。

20
00:01:32,481 --> 00:01:35,271
You know it's my first time here the city is crazy.
你知道，这是我第一次来，这座城市真不可思议。

21
00:01:35,281 --> 00:01:40,551
You have to walk a lot every day right and it's confusing because like down up.
每天都得走很多路，对吧？而且让人迷糊，一会儿下、一会儿上。

22
00:01:40,561 --> 00:01:51,658
What do you think about america shooting every day yeah many shootings many shootings.
你们怎么看美国？对方提到枪击，双方重复确认；这是现场个人印象。

23
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:57,841
It's no surprise that gun violence is the first thing these locals think of when they think about america.
Drew 说，他不意外这些当地人在想到美国时首先想到枪支暴力。

24
00:01:57,841 --> 00:02:02,481
Even though it's incredibly safe here I still want a guide to explore the hidden corners of the city.
虽然他当时觉得这里很安全，但仍想找导游探索城市隐秘的角落。

25
00:02:02,481 --> 00:02:04,800
That's why I'm about to meet up with my local friend joy.
所以他正准备和当地朋友 Joy 见面。

26
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:11,911
Who's taking me to the chongqing zoo famous for being one of the best zoos in the world and home to 22 resident panda bears.
Joy 要带他去重庆动物园；Drew 当时称赞它，也提到那里有二十二只常住熊猫，数字待核。

27
00:02:11,921 --> 00:02:15,893
Hello I will show you the pandas there's a fat panda over there.
你好，我给你看熊猫。那边有一只胖胖的熊猫。

28
00:02:15,921 --> 00:02:19,520
Whoa this is the first time in my life I've seen a panda with my own eyes.
哇，这是我人生第一次亲眼看见熊猫。

29
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:24,391
Why is it yellow I guess because they have a long time haven't had a shower.
为什么它黄黄的？对方开玩笑说，也许是很久没洗澡。

30
00:02:24,401 --> 00:02:29,681
I wasn't expecting to see pandas when I'm here this is so cool it's like a bucket list for china you know.
没想到来这里还能看到熊猫，太酷了，像完成了来中国的一项愿望。

31
00:02:29,681 --> 00:02:39,440
Check see the pandas great wild china pandas you know everybody thinks that chindu is a city of pandas nobody realizes that there's more pandas in chongqing than chindu.
看熊猫打勾！接着两人比较重庆与成都的熊猫数量；地名和比较都按原声说法待核。

32
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:43,520
It's crazy how in the middle of the panda park there's like these high rise apartments.
很奇妙，熊猫园中间或附近就能看到这些高层住宅。

33
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:52,311
All the panda things panda panda panda panda all right joy joyy's a driver in this crazy city.
满眼都是熊猫元素。好，Joy 开着车，在这座让人惊叹的城市穿行。

34
00:02:52,321 --> 00:02:56,161
Driving through chongqing it's crazy you just see so many buildings.
开车穿过重庆，真的能看到好多建筑。

35
00:02:56,161 --> 00:03:02,071
Do you think all these buildings are full in this area yeah it's full cuz this is old area.
你觉得这片楼都住满了吗？对方说，这一带是老城区，已经住满。

36
00:03:02,081 --> 00:03:07,601
It seems like every 5 minutes you're crossing another bridge in this city so so so cool.
感觉每隔五分钟就过一座桥，真是太酷了。

37
00:03:07,601 --> 00:03:13,361
This building in front of us looks like the marina bay sands and as joey just told me it was made by singaporeans.
前面这栋楼看起来像滨海湾金沙；Joy 刚告诉他，说是新加坡人建的，来源待核。
